              "audioStart": 88.338,
              "audioEnd": 91.925
            },
            {
              "text": "Even children knew her name and waved to her when she passed by.",
              "audioStart": 92.787,
              "audioEnd": 95.862
            },
            {
              "text": "She spent hours washing and drying different types of fabric.",
              "audioStart": 96.725,
              "audioEnd": 99.838
            },
            {
              "text": "The water came from a clear stream that flowed near her home.",
              "audioStart": 100.7,
              "audioEnd": 103.625
            },
            {
              "text": "She used natural soap that made the clothes smell fresh and sweet.",
              "audioStart": 104.487,
              "audioEnd": 107.75
            },
            {
              "text": "Every piece of clothing was treated with great care.",
              "audioStart": 108.612,
              "audioEnd": 111.188
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing was ever damaged while it was in her hands.",
              "audioStart": 112.05,
              "audioEnd": 114.612
            },
            {
              "text": "She checked every pocket before the washing process began.",
              "audioStart": 115.475,
              "audioEnd": 118.463
            },
            {
              "text": "If she found any coins or paper, she kept them safely until the owner returned.",
              "audioStart": 119.325,
              "audioEnd": 123.763
            },
            {
              "text": "This honesty made her even more popular among the local residents.",
              "audioStart": 124.625,
              "audioEnd": 128.175
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Kirpi started to walk up a high hill where the path was narrow and rough.",
              "audioStart": 129.037,
              "audioEnd": 132.55
            },
            {
              "text": "She looked around every tree and under every green plant for the lost clothes.",
              "audioStart": 133.412,
              "audioEnd": 137.475
            },
            {
              "text": "After a long time, she heard a soft sound coming from a tiny stone house.",
              "audioStart": 138.338,
              "audioEnd": 142.438
            },
            {
              "text": "When she opened the door, a wonderful smell of warm water and clean air filled the place.",
              "audioStart": 143.3,
              "audioEnd": 148.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Inside the little room, a nice creature was busy washing clothes in a small container.",
              "audioStart": 148.887,
              "audioEnd": 153.325
            },
            {
              "text": "The walls were clean, and many freshly washed items hung on lines across the top part of the room.",
              "audioStart": 154.188,
              "audioEnd": 159.338
            },
            {
              "text": "Kirpi smiled because she saw all the missing things resting safely on a wooden table.",
