              "audioEnd": 164.45
            },
            {
              "text": "The worker welcomed her visitor and offered some hot tea to drink.",
              "audioStart": 165.312,
              "audioEnd": 168.65
            },
            {
              "text": "They spent a happy hour together talking about the valley and the lovely spring weather.",
              "audioStart": 169.512,
              "audioEnd": 173.688
            },
            {
              "text": "The friendly creature explained why those items had been taken.",
