              "audioEnd": 177.75
            },
            {
              "text": "They had been collected by mistake because the wind had blown them away.",
              "audioStart": 178.613,
              "audioEnd": 181.963
            },
            {
              "text": "Kirpi understood the situation and forgave her new friend immediately.",
              "audioStart": 182.825,
              "audioEnd": 186.412
            },
            {
              "text": "They agreed that such an accident should never happen again.",
              "audioStart": 187.275,
              "audioEnd": 190.088
            },
            {
              "text": "They shared stories about their lives and laughed together.",
              "audioStart": 190.95,
              "audioEnd": 193.762
            },
            {
              "text": "The tea was hot and sweet, which made them feel very comfortable.",
