              "audioEnd": 206.8
            },
            {
              "text": "It was a quiet place where someone could rest and work in peace.",
              "audioStart": 207.662,
              "audioEnd": 210.887
            },
            {
              "text": "The other worker was happy to have a visitor to talk with.",
              "audioStart": 211.75,
              "audioEnd": 214.488
            },
            {
              "text": "They promised to visit each other more often in the future.",
              "audioStart": 215.35,
              "audioEnd": 218.088
            },
            {
              "text": "Spring days were long, and there was plenty of time for friendship.",
              "audioStart": 218.95,
              "audioEnd": 222.363
            },
            {
              "text": "They watched the sun move slowly across the blue sky.",
