            {
              "text": "The air was filled with the sweet scent of flowers from the garden.",
              "audioStart": 233.912,
              "audioEnd": 236.812
            },
            {
              "text": "Kirpi felt a deep sense of joy in her heart.",
              "audioStart": 237.675,
              "audioEnd": 239.988
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that her long walk up the hill had been worthwhile.",
              "audioStart": 240.85,
              "audioEnd": 243.65
