              "audioEnd": 261.24
            },
            {
              "text": "She thanked her new friend and walked back down the hill toward her own home.",
              "audioStart": 262.103,
              "audioEnd": 265.728
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day on, no more small clothes ever went missing in the country.",
              "audioStart": 266.591,
              "audioEnd": 270.503
            },
            {
              "text": "People were very happy because their things were always safe now.",
