            {
              "text": "Kirpi continued to work hard every single day to help anyone who needed her assistance.",
              "audioStart": 275.328,
              "audioEnd": 279.99
            },
            {
              "text": "Life in the green country was quiet, and everyone lived together with good friendship.",
              "audioStart": 280.853,
              "audioEnd": 285.216
            },
            {
              "text": "The small animal became famous among all the residents of the region.",
              "audioStart": 286.078,
              "audioEnd": 289.553
            },
            {
              "text": "Many years passed, but people still remembered the great work of the wonderful worker.",
              "audioStart": 290.416,
              "audioEnd": 294.916
            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever any problem happened, the community knew exactly who could help them find a solution.",
              "audioStart": 295.778,
              "audioEnd": 300.653
            },
            {
              "text": "The little stone house on the hill remained a symbol of friendship and good work for the future.",
              "audioStart": 301.515,
              "audioEnd": 305.828
            },
            {
              "text": "New families moved into the valley and heard the story about Kirpi.",
              "audioStart": 306.69,
              "audioEnd": 309.953
            },
            {
              "text": "They were always amazed by her kindness and dedication.",
              "audioStart": 310.815,
              "audioEnd": 313.74
            },
            {
              "text": "She became a true legend among the younger generations.",
              "audioStart": 314.603,
              "audioEnd": 317.528
            },
            {
              "text": "Her name was mentioned with great respect at every public meeting.",
              "audioStart": 318.39,
              "audioEnd": 321.703
            },
            {
              "text": "Even though she grew older, her hands remained strong and steady.",
              "audioStart": 322.565,
              "audioEnd": 325.753
            },
            {
              "text": "She taught her skills to anyone who wanted to learn the trade.",
              "audioStart": 326.615,
              "audioEnd": 329.478
            },
            {
              "text": "Many young people came to her house to receive proper training.",
              "audioStart": 330.341,
              "audioEnd": 333.49
            },
            {
              "text": "She showed them how to wash clothes without causing any damage.",
              "audioStart": 334.353,
              "audioEnd": 337.565
            },
            {
              "text": "She explained the importance of honesty and hard work in life.",
              "audioStart": 338.428,
              "audioEnd": 341.678
            },
            {
              "text": "Her students respected her as a wise and patient teacher.",
              "audioStart": 342.541,
              "audioEnd": 345.541
            },
            {
              "text": "The community grew larger, but the spirit of the valley never changed.",
              "audioStart": 346.403,
              "audioEnd": 350.216
            },
            {
              "text": "People supported one another through good times and bad times.",
              "audioStart": 351.078,
              "audioEnd": 354.278
            },
            {
              "text": "Kirpi lived a long and happy life surrounded by friends.",
              "audioStart": 355.14,
              "audioEnd": 358.203
            },
            {
              "text": "When she finally retired, the whole town threw a big party for her.",
              "audioStart": 359.065,
              "audioEnd": 362.615
            },
            {
              "text": "There was music, dancing, and plenty of delicious food to eat.",
