              "audioEnd": 374.765
            },
            {
              "text": "Her legacy lived on in the hearts of everyone in the green country.",
              "audioStart": 375.628,
              "audioEnd": 378.853
            },
            {
              "text": "The little stone house and the stream remained important places for the local history.",
